Package: libpdfium-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libpdfium20250629 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libfreetype-dev,
 liblcms2-dev,
 libjpeg-dev,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: development headers and libraries for PDFium
 PDFium is a high-performance PDF rendering library originally developed
 by Google. This package contains the headers, CMake files, and static/dynamic
 libraries required to develop applications against PDFium.

Package: libpdfium20250629
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: PDFium rendering library snapshot (2025-06-29)
 PDFium is a fast, high-quality C++ library for PDF rendering.
 This package provides the shared runtime library built from a snapshot
 of upstream on 2025-06-29.
